<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<gpx xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" version="1.1" creator="mtl_bike tools/build.py" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1 http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1/gpx.xsd"><metadata><name>Day 3 (Tuesday Oct 6): Troy to Ticonderoga, NY</name><desc>93.2 mi (150.0 km), about +2,600 ft. Routed on OpenStreetMap along the official trails.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="42.73414" lon="-73.68843"><name>Hotel: Best Western Plus Franklin Square Inn Troy/Albany</name><desc>Mile 94.7. 1 4th St, Troy, NY. (518) 274-8800. Downtown Troy.</desc><sym>Lodging</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="43.54666" lon="-73.40687"><name>Lunch: Whitehall Market</name><desc>Mile 66.5. 192 Broadway, Whitehall, NY. . Full grocery store (opened May 2026) on the route in Whitehall village, with a deli counter for hot and cold sandwiches and plenty of drinks and snacks. Ride-tested Oct 2026: decent deli sandwiches. Hours and phone not verified. Backup: Stewart's Shops, 60 Poultney St.</desc><sym>Restaurant</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="43.84798" lon="-73.43417"><name>Hotel: Circle Court Motel</name><desc>Mile 93.2. 6 Montcalm St, Ticonderoga, NY. (518) 585-7660. Small motel at the west end of Montcalm St, near the NY-9N/22 junction; Stewart's (26 Montcalm St) is nearby.</desc><sym>Lodging</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="43.85829" lon="-73.42782"><name>Hotel: Best Western Plus Ticonderoga Inn &amp; Suites</name><desc>Mile 92.7, 0.7 mi off route. 260 Burgoyne Rd, Ticonderoga, NY. (518) 585-2378. On the south side of town, right on the route.</desc><sym>Lodging</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="43.41500" lon="-73.49100"><name>Bike: Walker's Farm, Home &amp; Tack</name><desc>Mile 53.9, 0.2 mi off route. 5565 State Route 4, Fort Ann, NY. (518) 639-5223. Farm and hardware store, NOT a bike shop: basic tools and supplies only. Listed Mon to Fri 8 to 6, Sat 8 to 5, Sun 9 to 4.</desc><sym>Bike Trail</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="43.26976" lon="-73.58040"><name>Station: Fort Edward-Glens Falls</name><desc>Mile 41.8, 0.1 mi off route.</desc><sym>Train</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="43.55477" lon="-73.40323"><name>Station: Whitehall</name><desc>Mile 67.2, 0.0 mi off route.</desc><sym>Train</sym></wpt>
